# Licensed photographic originals. The book places 2,400px derivatives
# (363 dpi at the plate size); these full-resolution sources are archival
# and too large for version control. Re-download via the licence if a
# future edition places them larger.
publication/img/source/

# The large-print variant, built on demand with `npm run curriculum:large`.
# It is the same book set at 135% and is a second artefact of the same
# size as the standard edition; the capability is in the source, so the
# file does not need to be in the history.
publication/IEFC Complete Curriculum (Large Print).pdf
publication/.flagship-large.html
publication/img/.resample.html

# The Student Edition is the Teacher's Edition minus the answer keys and
# the teaching guide — a 25 MB near-duplicate of a file already in the
# history. The Institutional Edition is committed because it is a
# genuinely different book. Build the student edition on demand:
#   npm run curriculum:student
publication/IEFC Complete Curriculum (Student Edition).pdf
publication/IEFC Complete Curriculum (Student Edition) — Cover Artwork.pdf
publication/.student.html
publication/.cover-student.html
publication/.institutional.html

